  "body": "<a name=\"release-21-15-13-fixed\"></a>\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n- On Windows, include bytecode cache directories and temporary bytecode files when checking whether `--symlink-app-data` needs the seed image's 8.3 short path. This lets virtualenv build seed images when the wheel files fit within the legacy path limit and bytecode compilation needs more room ([#3758](https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3758)) by @darrenhuai and @gaborbernat.\n\n[🐍 PyPI release](https://pypi.org/project/virtualenv/21.15.13/)\n\n[📜 Full Changelog](https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/compare/21.15.12...21.15.13)\n",
